SUMMARY:Free Walking Tour Le Marais
LOCATION:Fontaine Stravinsky\, Rue Brisemiche\, Paris\, France
URL:https://www.billetweb.fr/free-walking-tour-le-marais1
DESCRIPTION:Venue: Fontaine Stravinsky\, Rue Brisemiche\, Paris\, France\nC
 ome to discover the prettiest spots\, stories and funny facts of Le Marais
  with Paris Erasmus Life - Apero at the end This visit is offered by true 
 Parisian students\, it will be the perfect opportunity for you all to visi
 t Paris through a different lens. In the heart of Paris\, if you were to i
 nquire about a local's preferred neighborhood\, the resounding answer ofte
 n points to Le Marais. A truly unique blend of fashion\, LGBT pride\, Jewi
 sh heritage\, and aristocratic history converge within this district's bou
 ndaries. The synthesis of these diverse cultures in this modern enclave gi
 ves rise to an atmosphere that is nothing short of exceptional. Tour Date:
  Saturday\, September 5 & 26 Time: 3:00 PM Meeting Point: Fontaine Stravin
 sky What Awaits You: Unveil the District's Charismatic Spots: Delve into t
 he enchanting locales that contribute to Le Marais's irresistible charm. R
 ecount the Stories that Forged Le Marais's Legacy: Immerse yourself in the
  narratives that have intricately woven the legendary fabric of Le Marais.
  Forge International Connections: Forge new friendships as you journey alo
 ngside fellow international explorers. Special Ending : At the end of the 
 tour\, all participants...\n\nhttps://www.billetweb.fr/free-walking-tour-l
 e-marais1
END:VEVENT
